('105-4301-057','105-4301',57,'single_choice',2,'John, driving his truck on the street, was attracted by a burning car on his left side, then hit Mary, causing her personal injury. John felt sorry for Mary, but did not offer anything to compensate Mary. Which of the following is INCORRECT at law?','Mary may sue John on negligence to recover damages for her personal injury.','John is not held criminally liable for his negligence unless Mary places criminal charge against John within six months after the incident.','John is not legally liable for this incident at all for it is no more than an accident.','The fact that Mary is covered by accident insurance is not a defense for John not to compensate Mary.',null,'法學英文','未分類','{}'::text[],null,null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],11,11,'parsed','pending_manual_review',null,true),
